## Original Content
<p>I'm excited to share that Coursera is making a $100 million strategic investment in LearnVector Inc., a newly formed AI-native learning company founded and led by Andrew Ng — one of the world's most influential figures in AI. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/coursera-invests-in-learnvector-to-build-the-future-of-ai-native-learning/">Coursera invests in LearnVector to build the future of AI-native learning</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Coursera has announced a $100 million strategic investment in LearnVector Inc., a newly formed AI-native learning company. LearnVector is founded and led by Andrew Ng, a prominent figure in AI. The investment aims to advance AI-driven technologies in education.

## Key Points
- Coursera invests $100 million in LearnVector.
- LearnVector is an AI-native learning company founded by Andrew Ng.
- Andrew Ng is a leading influencer in artificial intelligence.
- The investment is strategic and focused on building the future of AI-based learning.
- This partnership highlights the growth of AI in educational technology.


